INSERT INTO "part" VALUES('prt_127203cec001ZI6eRiZ8EP4y7I','msg_127202a88001ljIYXIH5vcBr0w','ses_ed8dfd641ffeiswxPR4l6T6Mlw',1791657786604,1791657786862,'{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"9f0287eb-67a6-4932-8bcf-ef5166301df8","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/shop.py"},"output":"<path>/workspace/shop.py</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: ## This is a human comment!\n2: \n3: def total(prices):\n4:     return sum(prices)\n5: \n6: \n7: def apply_discount(price, percent):\n8:     return price * (1 - percent / 100)\n9: \n10: \n11: def average(prices):\n12:     if not prices:\n13:         return 0.0\n14:     return sum(prices) / len(prices)\n15: \n16: \n17: def median(prices):\n18:     if not prices:\n19:         return 0.0\n20: \n21:     ordered_prices = sorted(prices)\n22:     middle = len(ordered_prices) // 2\n23:     if len(ordered_prices) % 2:\n24:         return ordered_prices[middle]\n25:     return (ordered_prices[middle - 1] + ordered_prices[middle]) / 2\n26: \n27: \n28: def divide(a, b):\n29:     return a / b\n30: \n31: \n32: def multiply(a, b):\n33:     return a * b\n34: \n35: \n36: def multiply(a, b):\n37:     return a * b\n38: \n39: \n40: def multiply_arrays(a, b):\n41:     if len(a) != len(b):\n42:         raise ValueError(\"arrays must have the same length\")\n43:     return [x * y for x, y in zip(a, b)]\n44: \n45: \n46: def subtract(a, b):\n47:     return a - b\n48: \n49: \n50: if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n51:     print(\"Hello, world!\")\n\n(End of file - total 51 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"## This is a human comment!\n\ndef total(prices):\n    return sum(prices)\n\n\ndef apply_discount(price, percent):\n    return price * (1 - percent / 100)\n\n\ndef average(prices):\n    if not prices:\n        return 0.0\n    return sum(prices) / len(prices)\n\n\ndef median(prices):\n    if not prices:\n        return 0.0\n","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/workspace/shop.py","text":"## This is a human comment!\n\ndef total(prices):\n    return sum(prices)\n\n\ndef apply_discount(price, percent):\n    return price * (1 - percent / 100)\n\n\ndef average(prices):\n    if not prices:\n        return 0.0\n    return sum(prices) / len(prices)\n\n\ndef median(prices):\n    if not prices:\n        return 0.0\n\n    ordered_prices = sorted(prices)\n    middle = len(ordered_prices) // 2\n    if len(ordered_prices) % 2:\n        return ordered_prices[middle]\n    return (ordered_prices[middle - 1] + ordered_prices[middle]) / 2\n\n\ndef divide(a, b):\n    return a / b\n\n\ndef multiply(a, b):\n    return a * b\n\n\ndef multiply(a, b):\n    return a * b\n\n\ndef multiply_arrays(a, b):\n    if len(a) != len(b):\n        raise ValueError(\"arrays must have the same length\")\n    return [x * y for x, y in zip(a, b)]\n\n\ndef subtract(a, b):\n    return a - b\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    print(\"Hello, world!\")","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":51,"totalLines":51,"truncated":false}},"title":"shop.py","time":{"start":1791657786742,"end":1791657786861}}}');
